WEBVTT

01:42.018 --> 01:46.940
EAT MY VOW

01:48.233 --> 01:51.444
Thank you for waiting.
One large dandelion udon with egg.

01:53.947 --> 01:55.990
It smells wonderful.

01:57.492 --> 01:59.285
Why don't you sit down?

02:01.496 --> 02:04.499
This is my friend from high school.

02:04.582 --> 02:08.419
You have a girlfriend? Oh, my.

02:11.714 --> 02:14.259
Thanks for thinking of me.

02:14.342 --> 02:20.098
It's nothing.
I've been wanting to see where you work.

02:20.849 --> 02:23.101
It's nice.
You even have seats for smaller animals.

02:24.477 --> 02:25.770
Thanks for the food.

02:27.856 --> 02:32.318
I was just surprised
that you mix in the egg first.

02:32.902 --> 02:36.698
Of course I do.
That's why it's in the bowl.

02:46.875 --> 02:48.459
It's delicious!

02:58.845 --> 02:59.846
Haru.

03:01.347 --> 03:03.433
There's something I have to tell you.

03:04.142 --> 03:07.145
I didn't get a chance
to tell you at the bus stop.

03:08.938 --> 03:10.231
Is now a good time?

03:11.691 --> 03:13.443
The reason I dropped out of school

03:15.820 --> 03:17.822
is because I ate Louis's leg.

03:19.324 --> 03:20.158
Come on.

03:20.867 --> 03:22.410
I'm trying to eat here.

03:25.204 --> 03:26.706
Haru?

03:29.959 --> 03:31.002
Your present.

03:31.502 --> 03:33.630
Let's go buy you a birthday present.

03:34.297 --> 03:35.924
Tell me then.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.217
While we're on a date.

03:40.762 --> 03:42.680
Take the rest of the day off.

03:49.187 --> 03:52.440
- Look at all those! Which one do you want?
- Where?

03:53.107 --> 03:54.859
They're huge!

03:54.943 --> 03:56.110
Amazing, huh?

03:56.194 --> 03:57.654
They used to be this big.

03:57.737 --> 03:59.656
- Wow, really?
- Yeah.

04:00.615 --> 04:03.993
- Look at me! How do I look?
- You look great.

04:04.077 --> 04:06.663
<i>I told her everything.</i>

04:07.538 --> 04:10.541
<i>Discovering that Riz was the devourer
and fighting him.</i>

04:11.376 --> 04:15.964
<i>How Louis let me eat his leg
to give me the strength to beat Riz.</i>

04:16.547 --> 04:19.050
Wow. You really get withdrawal symptoms?

04:19.133 --> 04:23.554
Yeah. Sometimes I can't control myself
when I'm around herbivores.

04:24.055 --> 04:26.641
But I'm okay right now, of course.

04:26.724 --> 04:29.769
I see. How about some mint?

04:29.852 --> 04:31.312
It has relaxing properties.

04:32.188 --> 04:33.314
It does?

04:37.110 --> 04:40.947
<i>I didn't even think to consider</i>

04:41.698 --> 04:43.950
<i>what Legoshi has been doing all this time.</i>

04:44.909 --> 04:46.619
<i>Maybe I was afraid of what I'd find out.</i>

04:49.163 --> 04:49.998
This is nice.

04:58.631 --> 05:00.341
The Cherryton windmill!

05:00.925 --> 05:03.720
And up there is where
you pulled your fangs out, right?

05:04.887 --> 05:06.889
That's right.

05:11.060 --> 05:13.354
This gate ruins everything.

05:13.438 --> 05:15.106
That's the way it has to be.

05:15.189 --> 05:18.192
They don't want any incidents
between carnivores and herbivores.

05:18.276 --> 05:20.737
I know, but it ruins the atmosphere.

05:22.071 --> 05:23.072
Hey, Haru.

05:24.324 --> 05:25.950
How do you really feel?

05:27.368 --> 05:31.581
He may have agreed to it,
but I did eat Louis's leg.

05:33.124 --> 05:35.752
I can imagine what you think of me.

05:39.380 --> 05:42.550
If you want, I could cry
and tell you how horrible you are.

05:43.134 --> 05:46.095
But I'll let everyone else do that.

05:50.016 --> 05:53.811
I want to face you in my own way.

05:55.354 --> 05:58.441
What happened between you and Louis
is your own business.

05:59.817 --> 06:03.321
And it's not like I've led
a perfect life by any means.

06:05.865 --> 06:08.910
For carnivores and herbivores
to truly understand each other,

06:09.410 --> 06:11.537
they have to face each other honestly.

06:13.372 --> 06:16.542
I'm ready to do that.

06:20.171 --> 06:23.674
There's one more place
I want to go with you.

06:25.927 --> 06:26.928
The Black Market.

06:27.553 --> 06:30.056
- Take me to the Black Market.
- I can't.

06:30.139 --> 06:32.683
I want to know everything
about the person I like.

06:36.062 --> 06:39.065
Let's go on a date at the Black Market.

06:42.235 --> 06:45.238
Haru, I don't think we should do this.

06:45.947 --> 06:47.490
I'm not scared.

06:48.658 --> 06:50.409
Haru! Wait!

06:52.370 --> 06:53.579
What are you doing?

06:53.663 --> 06:54.914
At least hide your face.

06:56.249 --> 07:01.587
- You'll stretch out my favorite shirt.
- Sorry. But your life is more important.

07:01.671 --> 07:03.589
You worry too much.

07:05.133 --> 07:06.843
I can't see!

07:10.805 --> 07:13.266
Come on. Move your hand.

07:13.349 --> 07:14.725
But...

07:14.809 --> 07:16.352
I can't see anything!

07:21.732 --> 07:23.734
Fresh meat! Come and get it!

07:25.820 --> 07:27.071
Haru.

07:27.780 --> 07:28.781
Haru!

07:29.991 --> 07:32.535
Hey, there. I'll give you a good deal.

07:32.618 --> 07:36.038
- Canines love these sausages!
- Goat meat is our specialty!

07:36.122 --> 07:37.540
Fresh poultry over here!

07:37.623 --> 07:40.001
Well, if it isn't the young wolf.

07:40.084 --> 07:44.255
- Oh, it's been a while.
- This has fresh bamboo in it.

07:44.338 --> 07:46.090
Maybe another time.

07:53.097 --> 07:56.642
- I've got fresh rats. How about a taste?
- No, thank you.

08:18.623 --> 08:21.792
Haru. You have to stay close to me.

08:26.380 --> 08:27.465
Haru!

08:28.799 --> 08:30.259
That's it. We're leaving.

08:31.219 --> 08:32.220
Haru.

08:37.475 --> 08:40.394
Haru. It's dangerous.

08:41.646 --> 08:42.563
Over there.

08:43.981 --> 08:45.900
RABBIT

08:45.983 --> 08:47.610
You can't go in there!

09:04.335 --> 09:05.336
You know,

09:06.462 --> 09:10.508
I've always hated the fact
that I was born as such a weak animal.

09:12.134 --> 09:13.219
I hate it so much.

09:14.971 --> 09:16.973
That's why I turned to sex.

09:19.016 --> 09:23.312
In bed, I felt like
I could be equals with anyone.

09:25.106 --> 09:26.232
How messed up is that?

09:27.733 --> 09:29.652
I was so dumb back then.

09:30.861 --> 09:32.780
I could've gotten hurt.

09:35.241 --> 09:36.242
But now,

09:37.577 --> 09:40.413
I don't need to be
self-destructive anymore.

09:43.165 --> 09:46.085
Because I have you by my side, Legoshi.

09:46.836 --> 09:50.298
It feels like... my stomach's in knots.

09:50.923 --> 09:52.800
I know you're surrounded by food,

09:52.883 --> 09:55.136
but how can you get hungry
at a time like this?

09:55.219 --> 09:56.262
That's not it!

09:57.513 --> 09:58.514
Legoshi.

09:59.974 --> 10:00.975
Kiss me.

10:02.685 --> 10:05.646
Kiss me right here.

10:09.859 --> 10:11.736
Forget about carnivores and herbivores.

10:13.404 --> 10:15.323
Let it be a ceremony between you and me.

10:23.372 --> 10:24.206
I can't.

10:25.833 --> 10:26.959
I told you, didn't I?

10:27.627 --> 10:30.713
A carnivore with a record of devouring
can't marry an herbivore.

10:30.796 --> 10:32.798
I don't care about marriage.

10:32.882 --> 10:35.009
As long as we understand each other.

10:35.092 --> 10:36.385
That's not enough.

10:36.469 --> 10:39.847
I want to have a family with you.
I want children. So...

10:39.930 --> 10:42.558
I can't do something so shameful to you
in my current state.

10:43.559 --> 10:46.937
I turn 18 today.
I want to do things right.

10:47.521 --> 10:51.984
Legally, my grandfather
and mother aren't even my real family.

10:52.068 --> 10:54.862
So I know how hard that kind of thing is.

10:54.945 --> 10:58.032
That's why I want you to wait
until I have things sorted out.

10:58.574 --> 11:00.660
- Give me a break!
- Excuse me?

11:02.119 --> 11:04.205
What's going on here?

11:04.288 --> 11:05.581
How much am I worth?

11:06.165 --> 11:08.000
- Haru!
- How much is my meat worth?

11:08.084 --> 11:09.543
This wolf is going to buy me.

11:09.627 --> 11:10.628
What are you saying?

11:10.711 --> 11:13.005
You're the one not making sense!

11:13.089 --> 11:14.507
I don't get you at all!

11:14.590 --> 11:16.092
Sorry about that. She's joking.

11:16.717 --> 11:18.427
No, I'm not!

11:18.511 --> 11:19.512
Forget it.

11:19.595 --> 11:22.098
- Wait! It's dangerous out there!
- My product...

11:22.181 --> 11:23.182
Haru!

11:25.976 --> 11:28.521
She would have been worth a pretty penny.

11:40.616 --> 11:42.118
<i>I can't concentrate.</i>

11:42.993 --> 11:44.245
<i>Damn it.</i>

11:47.665 --> 11:49.750
<i>Meat withdrawal symptoms?</i>

11:51.210 --> 11:52.211
<i>Goodness.</i>

11:56.132 --> 11:56.966
<i>No.</i>

11:57.716 --> 12:00.386
<i>He'd be sweating more
if that were the case.</i>

12:01.512 --> 12:02.513
Hey. You.

12:04.265 --> 12:06.392
Have a mint. It'll calm you down.

12:07.059 --> 12:07.893
Take it.

12:09.603 --> 12:12.731
Sorry, thanks.

12:15.443 --> 12:16.444
Is that...

12:17.194 --> 12:18.195
Kines?

12:21.240 --> 12:23.075
Give me a break.

12:23.159 --> 12:26.954
Your father will chew me out
if he finds out about this.

12:27.538 --> 12:29.790
I'd be risking my job.
Do you understand that?

12:30.374 --> 12:33.794
I do. That's why we'll keep it a secret.

12:36.505 --> 12:38.924
Well, it does sound fun.

12:41.677 --> 12:43.220
Kines, huh.

12:44.013 --> 12:46.640
What do you want to analyze this for?

12:46.724 --> 12:49.059
It's for a school project.

12:49.143 --> 12:51.270
You mean for the public, right?

12:53.606 --> 12:56.275
Fine. Come get the results next week.

12:56.775 --> 12:59.737
And when you finally
take over the company--

12:59.820 --> 13:03.532
Funding for your research, right?
I'll make sure you get more.

13:03.616 --> 13:04.950
And a smoking room, too.

13:07.286 --> 13:09.663
Don't let me draw the short straw.

13:12.833 --> 13:16.629
<i>Why is everyone around me
so hard to deal with?</i>

13:23.010 --> 13:26.138
<i>This female wolf is no exception.</i>

13:27.056 --> 13:28.807
Your eyesight is impressive.

13:28.933 --> 13:31.227
I'm scared of bugs!

13:31.310 --> 13:33.687
You didn't look scared
when you crushed it bare-handed.

13:34.188 --> 13:36.774
There's no need to be ashamed
of your instincts.

13:36.857 --> 13:40.319
They're so gross. I just hate them!

13:40.402 --> 13:46.242
<i>Juno and I have been meeting like this
once or twice a month.</i>

13:47.660 --> 13:49.161
<i>Ever since</i> that <i>happened.</i>

13:50.829 --> 13:56.627
<i>We've never talked about the kiss.
We only make small talk whenever we meet.</i>

13:57.127 --> 13:58.254
Louis.

13:58.921 --> 14:01.006
I've been thinking lately.

14:01.757 --> 14:06.595
You always say yes
when I invite you out like this.

14:07.137 --> 14:09.139
I was just wondering why.

14:09.223 --> 14:12.101
I'm just indulging your youthfulness.

14:12.601 --> 14:16.814
You're always talking like that.
Always looking down on people.

14:17.314 --> 14:18.857
You're 17, right?

14:18.941 --> 14:21.443
It's only natural
to be so curious about everything.

14:22.444 --> 14:26.365
Talking to older guys,
communicating with herbivores.

14:27.157 --> 14:30.452
I satisfy both those cravings.
How convenient for you.

14:32.371 --> 14:34.540
You're such a bully.

14:35.624 --> 14:39.461
You're petty, contrarian, and skinny.

14:39.545 --> 14:43.674
The more I think about it,
you're not my type at all.

14:43.757 --> 14:47.636
So, why do I like you so much?

14:48.178 --> 14:52.016
<i>Hasn't she ever heard
of an internal monologue?</i>

14:52.641 --> 14:56.020
<i>She thinks she can get away
with saying whatever she wants.</i>

14:56.103 --> 14:59.440
<i>In a way, she's scarier
than Legoshi and the Shishi-Gumi both.</i>

15:00.900 --> 15:04.320
You're not exactly my type, either.

15:05.237 --> 15:06.488
Let's call it a day.

15:07.406 --> 15:08.782
But you just got here!

15:08.866 --> 15:10.868
Come on. Let's go.

15:11.493 --> 15:12.494
Gosh.

15:22.713 --> 15:27.092
Do you have plans after this, Louis?

15:27.593 --> 15:28.427
Yes.

15:29.094 --> 15:30.512
I'm meeting my fiancée.

15:32.056 --> 15:33.474
Didn't I tell you?

15:34.266 --> 15:37.519
My future wife was decided
when I was just a child.

15:38.103 --> 15:40.522
She's the daughter
of the CEO of a big company,

15:41.065 --> 15:42.775
and a red deer like me.

15:44.443 --> 15:45.778
You have to understand.

15:46.445 --> 15:49.239
I have no ulterior motive
behind meeting with you.

15:51.951 --> 15:57.706
You told me
not to be ashamed of my instincts.

15:58.666 --> 16:02.544
You running away like that
just makes me want to chase after you.

16:03.879 --> 16:07.925
Did that remind you of our kiss that day?

16:10.094 --> 16:12.680
<i>I saw you looking at my chewed-up straw.</i>

16:14.556 --> 16:18.686
Don't you wonder what it would feel like?

16:19.687 --> 16:21.021
Being all chewed up.

16:23.941 --> 16:27.861
Blushing and putting on that predator act
won't work on grown-ups.

16:28.362 --> 16:29.780
Hey, that hurts!

16:31.240 --> 16:32.282
Stop it!

16:35.828 --> 16:36.662
See you later.

16:38.622 --> 16:43.210
There's no way it's going to work out!
It's nothing but a political marriage!

16:43.293 --> 16:49.425
You don't know what you're talking about.
We have a great relationship.

16:51.010 --> 16:54.888
UDON BEBEBE

16:56.432 --> 16:59.810
Um, Juno?

16:59.893 --> 17:02.062
Can you at least tell me
why you're crying?

17:03.814 --> 17:07.026
I really don't know
what's going on in your life these days.

17:10.529 --> 17:12.531
Did something happen in drama club?

17:16.201 --> 17:17.828
How'd you know I worked here?

17:18.662 --> 17:20.831
Everyone in the drama club knows.

17:20.914 --> 17:21.832
I see.

17:23.125 --> 17:26.670
- You're a real heartbreaker, Legoshi!
- It's not like that.

17:26.754 --> 17:28.881
- We were in a club--
- You make a lovely couple.

17:28.964 --> 17:30.424
No, we're not...

17:30.507 --> 17:33.635
I don't know what to do.

17:34.678 --> 17:38.390
You're the only one I can trust, <i>senpai.</i>

17:40.476 --> 17:42.728
Well, I'm happy to lend you an ear.

17:42.811 --> 17:46.940
But I dropped out. You don't have to
call me <i>"senpai"</i> anymore<i>.</i>

17:47.024 --> 17:48.400
No, you're still my <i>senpai!</i>

17:48.484 --> 17:51.320
You're experienced
in interspecies relationships.

17:52.404 --> 17:55.365
I need your relationship advice.

17:55.449 --> 17:57.576
It all started last year

17:57.659 --> 18:00.079
while we were preparing
for the Festival of the Meteor.

18:00.162 --> 18:03.832
I pushed him down in the practice room
when we were alone.

18:03.916 --> 18:06.293
I didn't think he was my type at all,

18:06.376 --> 18:08.670
but I went to see him
after you dropped out.

18:08.754 --> 18:12.007
That's when I realized
how strong and beautiful Louis is.

18:12.091 --> 18:13.884
When I saw him again at graduation,

18:13.967 --> 18:17.554
he had a cool, mature demeanor,
but he also looked childish and nervous.

18:17.638 --> 18:19.515
I couldn't help but kiss him!

18:19.598 --> 18:22.684
But Louis told me to forget about it, and...

18:23.852 --> 18:25.771
What do you think, Legoshi?

18:27.481 --> 18:28.315
Huh?

18:28.816 --> 18:29.817
Legoshi?

18:30.400 --> 18:32.319
Oh no, he's not moving.

18:33.320 --> 18:34.446
Legoshi?

18:35.447 --> 18:39.118
I guess I couldn't keep up
with all that drama.

18:39.201 --> 18:40.828
You froze.

18:41.411 --> 18:46.458
I thought you might.
I can't believe it either.

18:47.167 --> 18:50.963
I never thought I'd like Louis so much.

18:52.005 --> 18:54.550
<i>What I can't believe</i>

18:54.633 --> 18:57.636
<i>is that she kissed him on the very day
she realized she liked him.</i>

18:58.387 --> 19:02.349
<i>She did in one day
something that's taken me years.</i>

19:03.350 --> 19:07.437
Now that I've put it all out there,
I can't get him out of my head.

19:09.815 --> 19:11.775
Have you noticed, Legoshi?

19:12.568 --> 19:13.652
Noticed what?

19:14.236 --> 19:16.280
I've gained weight.

19:17.030 --> 19:20.492
Little by little,
each day since I fell in love with Louis.

19:21.535 --> 19:25.038
The more I think about him,
the hungrier I get.

19:26.456 --> 19:28.292
Isn't that terrifying?

19:29.376 --> 19:33.088
Love is supposed to give you butterflies.

19:33.172 --> 19:35.174
Not make your tummy rumble.

19:37.092 --> 19:38.510
Could it be?

19:38.594 --> 19:42.264
That deep down,
I really do want to eat him.

19:43.390 --> 19:47.477
Am I just mixing up hunger and love?

19:47.561 --> 19:50.439
You're the only one
I could turn to, Legoshi.

19:50.522 --> 19:53.442
Juno. I've gone through
the same thing myself, so--

19:53.525 --> 19:55.319
But for me,

19:55.402 --> 19:57.863
my carnivore traits
are my greatest strength!

19:58.530 --> 20:01.074
I'll stimulate him in ways
that a female herbivore can't

20:01.158 --> 20:02.784
and make him fall for me!

20:02.868 --> 20:04.077
I don't know about that...

20:04.161 --> 20:07.080
Legoshi, you're into that stubby little...

20:07.164 --> 20:08.582
Sorry, I didn't mean that.

20:09.166 --> 20:13.086
You're not turned off
by Haru's herbivore traits, right?

20:13.212 --> 20:14.838
That's what you like about her, right?

20:16.256 --> 20:17.341
You're right.

20:17.424 --> 20:19.051
I'm right?

20:19.927 --> 20:22.262
Don't you think Haru feels the same way?

20:23.555 --> 20:25.641
I don't think so...

20:25.724 --> 20:28.894
Then... how did you get her to fall for you?

20:28.977 --> 20:31.647
By being sincere? By being persistent?

20:32.940 --> 20:37.027
Legoshi, love is a battle!

20:37.110 --> 20:39.071
Don't tell me

20:39.696 --> 20:44.326
that you've convinced yourself
that she's already yours?

20:45.494 --> 20:47.371
I never thought about that.

20:48.288 --> 20:50.832
<i>So that's why she got mad at me...</i>

20:51.416 --> 20:53.377
Tweet tweet! What's up, everybody!

20:53.460 --> 20:55.504
This is P-Chan's Echo Channel.

20:55.587 --> 20:57.881
Got time for a question? Ta-da!

20:57.965 --> 21:00.717
How do you feel about
interspecies relationships?

21:00.801 --> 21:03.178
- I'm totally for it.
- Oh, sure, sure.

21:03.262 --> 21:06.765
But would you actually be in one yourself?

21:07.391 --> 21:09.059
Not just other people, but you.

21:09.184 --> 21:11.395
Maybe I shouldn't be asking a couple.

21:12.145 --> 21:13.897
We're not a couple.

21:14.690 --> 21:15.649
You're not?

21:16.191 --> 21:18.151
Maybe you're about to?

21:18.235 --> 21:19.236
What about you?

21:19.319 --> 21:21.446
Say a cute female herbivore
comes on to you.

21:21.530 --> 21:23.448
What do you do?

21:23.532 --> 21:26.493
- If I don't know them--
- Yeah, I agree. That's a no.

21:26.576 --> 21:31.206
What's your reason? According to my poll,
most agree that the risks are too high.

21:31.290 --> 21:34.042
It sure would suck to get eaten!

21:34.126 --> 21:35.002
Wait!

21:35.085 --> 21:38.714
- I'm madly in love with a red deer!
- Give it back.

21:38.797 --> 21:42.301
- I can't worry about any risks!
- Give it back.

21:42.384 --> 21:43.677
Assuming we're a couple.

21:43.760 --> 21:47.055
Everyone thinks they know everything!

21:47.139 --> 21:47.973
Give it back.

21:48.056 --> 21:52.561
Do any of you really think
you can decide what's best for me?

22:04.156 --> 22:05.782
<i>Juno...</i>

22:06.366 --> 22:07.451
<i>is exactly right.</i>

22:07.534 --> 22:10.996
